OL,3,GNEWSATeenage girl in hospital after bus
OL,4,Acollision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage girl has been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital after reportedly being hit by
OL,8,Fa bus while walking.
OL,10,FEast of England Ambulance Service said
OL,11,Fit was called to Castle Meadow in
OL,12,FNorwich at 17:50 BST.
OL,14,FA spokesperson said: "An ambulance, an
OL,15,Fambulance officer vehicle and a
OL,16,Fcritical care paramedic car were sent
OL,17,Fto the scene.
OL,19,F"The pedestrian, a teenage girl, was
OL,20,Ftransported to the Norfolk and Norwich
OL,21,FUniversity Hospital for further
OL,22,Fassessment and treatment."
